--  D855: an option cannot take a configuration atom's name, a system's
--  or `rv32` as well as the atoms D202 listed, since an option of
--  the name would be read in the atom's place: `compiler.os == linux`
--  would compare a system with a bool.
option linux: bool = true
option freestanding: u32 = 0
option rv32: bool = false
